- 'The best Daydream wall ever written??? Why?!?' -

Sit down and read this...


FEATURES:

+ great outlook
+ full stats door integrated with the sNOwALL 
+ scout door: look if the sysop is available and...
+ ...who door integrated with the sNOwALL (scout door + YOUR who door)
+ help on line
+ lines lenght variable ('mBB' can write more than 'bIGHANDLExyz')
  note: this make the outlook great, better than other walls
+ CHEAT MODE: users can gain credits with a sysop-configurable cheat!!!
+ all actions documented in the logfile
+ FREEWARE/MAILWARE (mail me comments and suggestions :)


FUTURE:

