INSTALLATION:


 -> +---------------+-------------------------+--------------------+
    |     FILE      |          PATH           |    COMMENT         |
    +---------------+-------------------------+--------------------+
    |  sNOWaLL.dd   | Daydream:Doors/Rexxdir/ |    main program    |
    +---------------+-------------------------+--------------------+
    |  sNOWaLL.dat  |   Daydream:Configs/     |    storage file    |
    +---------------+-------------------------+--------------------+
    | sNOWaLL.cheat |   Daydream:Configs/     | configuration file |
    +---------------+-------------------------+--------------------+

 -> Add this line to your Daydream:Display/iso/Welcome.GFX

---cut---
ÿDDoors:Rexx %N Doors:Rexxdir/snowall.dd||
---cut---


 -> (if you want) Configure with MUIconfig the sNOWaLL (rexx door)


